  "notes": "Cash basis county. Governmental funds only (fiduciary skipped). Statement lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (p4). Beginning cash not printed, so beginning_cash is null; the roll-forward uses cash basis fund balances (8,154,478 -> 8,402,562); ending cash 6,642,980 and investments 1,759,582 from p3. Statement 'Other' taxes 90,136 split: Visitors' Promotion Fund Other taxes 5,806 = lodging tax (fund name); remainder 84,330 = other taxes. Balance sheet from the governmental funds statement (p3), whose totals equal the Statement of Net Position (p1). Detail: General Fund budget schedule (p5; Taxes split using the p4 General Fund column); major funds budget schedule (p6; one-line disbursements given the function from p4; Highway Bridge Buyback Fund had no actual disbursements); nonmajor funds from the combining statement (pp9-11) per fund column, more detailed than the one-line nonmajor budget schedules (pp7-8), so those budget lines are not recorded (budget_final null). Noxious Weed Control Fund Public Works spending is natural resources/conservation in detail (statement Public Works line kept as printed). Transfers tie: in 1,538,875 = out 1,538,875. Read pages 1-11 of 11"
